# API contract

- Controllers and Pydantic models define the contract; committed artifacts are `backend/openapi.json` and `frontend/src/api/schema.ts`.
- After route/model changes run `./do update-api-schema`. CI runs `./do check-api-schema`.
- Update wrappers in `frontend/src/api/index.ts` to use generated `paths` only — no hand-written paths that are missing from OpenAPI.
- POST bodies use embed wrappers: `{ "node": … }`, `{ "tag": … }`, `{ "link": … }`.
- List routes are `/courses` and `/course/{course_uuid}/nodes|tags|links`. Callers must pass a real `course_uuid` from UI context.
